flowchart LR
  subgraph Loop["Loop engineering cycle"]
    direction TB
    A[Pull next task] --> B[Plan steps]
    B --> C[Act / implement]
    C --> D[Test / validate]
    D --> E{Pass?}
    E -->|yes| F[Report success + artifacts]
    E -->|no| G{Retries left?}
    G -->|yes| B
    G -->|no| H[Report failure / escalate]
    F --> I[Screenshot / PDF snapshot]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Update board + notify operator]
  end
